# Filled-in environment/device configuration stays private.
.env*
**/.env*
!.env.example
!**/.env.example
!**/*.env.example
*secrets*
**/*secrets*
!*secrets.example.h
!**/*secrets.example.h
**/*credentials*
**/*ADMIN*LOGIN*
**/*CLOUD*LOGIN*
**/auth.json
**/.runtime/
**/.aws/
**/.codex/
**/.agents/
**/.venv/
**/.pio/
**/vendor/
**/node_modules/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/.phpunit.cache/
**/.phpunit.result.cache
**/bootstrap/cache/**
!**/bootstrap/cache/.gitignore
**/storage/**
!**/storage/**/
!**/storage/**/.gitignore
**/public/build/
**/public/hot
**/public/storage/
**/*.bak
**/*.backup
**/*.old
**/*.bin
**/*.elf
**/*.vlx
**/*.zip
**/*.dump
**/*.sqlite*
**/*.db
**/*.log
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/*.pt
compile_commands.json
tmp/
Python/
